<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>球局 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%90%83%E5%B1%80/</link><description>Recent content in 球局 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%90%83%E5%B1%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>加入业余联赛：报名注册、定队服与赛季日程</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/joining-a-league/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/joining-a-league/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从想报名到赛季第一场打完去吃饭&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：问朋友怎么报名、第一次跟队集合领队服、群里排日程找替补、比赛里跟新队友磨合、赛后一起去吃饭。主角是第一次打联赛的你，带路的是打了两年的 Marcus，队长是 Tyler，教练是带队的 Coach。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>